{"4392530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hostile Paths", "steam_appid": 4392530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras/bdf431224c45c09355dd18322e016e0e.avif?t=1788201053\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras_big/bdf431224c45c09355dd18322e016e0e.webp?t=1788201053 width=1560 height=475 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hostile Paths</strong> is a top-down survival roguelike set in a bleak post-apocalyptic world scarred by war and scarcity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lone operator navigating hostile territories in a heavily worn tank. Every run is a fight for survival: manage <strong>fuel, food, and water</strong>, scavenge what remains, complete missions, and decide which dangers are worth facing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>procedurally generated maps</strong> with branching routes, enemies, survivors, and points of interest. Exploration is as important as combat, choosing when to fight, when to search for resources, and when to retreat can mean the difference between progressing deeper into the wasteland and losing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, collect <strong>weapons, equipment, and resources</strong> to adapt your tank to the challenges ahead. Travel through frozen wastelands, scorched deserts, and toxic territories, each introducing new environments, enemies, and threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push far enough and you'll face <strong>unique boss encounters</strong>, each built around different mechanics and attacks that force you to adapt how you fight and survive. Make it through them all and a final confrontation awaits at the end of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no safe routes, only hostile paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras/ed86b96a367d069995720c770a931e9a.avif?t=1788201053\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras_big/ed86b96a367d069995720c770a931e9a.avif?t=1788201053 width=1560 height=868 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival roguelike gameplay</strong> with permadeath</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage fuel, food, and water</strong> to survive each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong> with branching paths and points of interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge weapons and equipment</strong> to adapt your tank during each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore multiple hostile environments</strong>, from frozen wastelands to deserts and toxic zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight diverse enemies and unique bosses</strong> as the difficulty escalates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete missions and choose your battles</strong>, fighting isn't always the best option</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras/2395b8ba9d0785ca9e7f3a4efb450583.avif?t=1788201053\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras_big/2395b8ba9d0785ca9e7f3a4efb450583.avif?t=1788201053 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras/bdf431224c45c09355dd18322e016e0e.avif?t=1788201053\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras_big/bdf431224c45c09355dd18322e016e0e.webp?t=1788201053 width=1560 height=475 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hostile Paths</strong> is a top-down survival roguelike set in a bleak post-apocalyptic world scarred by war and scarcity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lone operator navigating hostile territories in a heavily worn tank. Every run is a fight for survival: manage <strong>fuel, food, and water</strong>, scavenge what remains, complete missions, and decide which dangers are worth facing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>procedurally generated maps</strong> with branching routes, enemies, survivors, and points of interest. Exploration is as important as combat, choosing when to fight, when to search for resources, and when to retreat can mean the difference between progressing deeper into the wasteland and losing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, collect <strong>weapons, equipment, and resources</strong> to adapt your tank to the challenges ahead. Travel through frozen wastelands, scorched deserts, and toxic territories, each introducing new environments, enemies, and threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push far enough and you'll face <strong>unique boss encounters</strong>, each built around different mechanics and attacks that force you to adapt how you fight and survive. Make it through them all and a final confrontation awaits at the end of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no safe routes, only hostile paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras/ed86b96a367d069995720c770a931e9a.avif?t=1788201053\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras_big/ed86b96a367d069995720c770a931e9a.avif?t=1788201053 width=1560 height=868 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival roguelike gameplay</strong> with permadeath</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage fuel, food, and water</strong> to survive each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong> with branching paths and points of interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge weapons and equipment</strong> to adapt your tank during each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore multiple hostile environments</strong>, from frozen wastelands to deserts and toxic zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight diverse enemies and unique bosses</strong> as the difficulty escalates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete missions and choose your battles</strong>, fighting isn't always the best option</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras/2395b8ba9d0785ca9e7f3a4efb450583.avif?t=1788201053\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/extras_big/2395b8ba9d0785ca9e7f3a4efb450583.avif?t=1788201053 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A gritty top-down survival roguelike where every run is a desperate fight for resources. Explore hostile paths, scavenge what remains, equip your tank, and survive a brutal post-apocalyptic world where no two runs are the same.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392530/eb07275ef00812471cc5efb37b11b72962265286/header.jpg?t=1788201053", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/